WEBVTT

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.890
Today was fun.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:08.900
Yeah.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.110
What’s that?

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:46.470
She must be it…

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.910
E-Er-… Emergency!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.420
Emergency!

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.010
What’s the matter?

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:14.810
Please look at this!

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:15.970
What is it?

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:22.220
“The Mystery of the City. A pretty girl who fights monsters at midnight.”

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.510
WHAT?!

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:28.060
Someone must have took
a picture of one of us!

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:32.720
If someone finds out my identity,
I’ll get picked on again!

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.190
Er, I think they’ll be scared of you instead…

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.310
Umm, but what should I do?

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.410
If Aoyama-kun finds out…

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:44.000
Don’t worry! The girl in the picture is not us.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:44.950
Huh?

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.150
Everyone…

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.830
LOOK AT THIS!!

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:50.180
That’s…!

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:52.420
…from when we went to the hot spring last time?

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.260
When did you take that picture?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.610
A scissor?

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:00.760
What are you using it for?

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.790
You’re going to cut it?

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:04.640
Tadah!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.440
Ichigo-oneechan…

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.190
(Note: “Oneechan/sama” here generally means “elder sister”)

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.940
…has no curves compared to this picture.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:11.690
Hmmph!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:16.640
Retasu-oneechan is too curvy compared to this picture!

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.200
Too curvy?..

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.780
Minto-oneechan on the other hand,
is too short.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.570
Everyone is WAY different!

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:26.150
So I have no curves, SORRY.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:29.120
Do you mean that I’m fat when you say too curvy?

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:33.870
I guess we can relax for now,
but I sure feel odd.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:39.250
Yes. We also haven’t fought anyone in the area mentioned in this article.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.290
That’s right.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.510
Then who could it be?

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.920
Huh! Could it be…

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.000
Is it…

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.510
The fifth companion?

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:48.850
Is something the matter?

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.010
What is it?

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:54.400
It’s the fifth member!

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:55.810
Hrm?

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.610
T-This is… This person is…

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.020
Do you know who it is, Minto?

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.700
No, I don’t know.

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.150
I don’t know.

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:07.660
Oh!

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:11.920
Whaaat?!?

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.240
What is that?..

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.780
Nothing.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:17.240
Show me!

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.680
Wait, I can’t!

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.880
I want to see it!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.880
If I say no, I mean no!

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:26.750
Show it!..

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.480
NOOooooo!..

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.350
I got it!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.150
What is this?

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:39.430
It’s an idol… photo book?

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.320
I-Is something wrong with it?

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:44.660
Why do you have this, Minto-san?

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.160
H-Hey, I just bought it out of a whim.

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.780
What are you doing to my important Zakuro’s photo book!

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.290
What are you doing!..

00:03:58.830 --> 00:03:59.950
Yayy!

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:00.840
Oneesama…

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.420
Look!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.420
It’s a perfect match!

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.250
What is this..?!

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.520
This silhouette that looks like a marble Muse.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.020
This is indeed Zakuro.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:22.110
Yes, Zakuro-oneesama is
the fifth member!

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.070
Whaat!?

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:31.280
Zakuro Fujiwara.
Born September 6th, a virgo.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:35.080
Height: 172cm. Weight: 49kg.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:40.790
She can speak English, French, German, and Chinese.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:45.550
She is gathering attention as an up-and-
coming model and international actress.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.920
With black opal-like hair…

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.880
Blue sapphire eyes that give a mysterious glitter…

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.510
…and legs as white as platinum…

00:04:55.510 --> 00:05:00.350
She is truly the best member we were looking for!

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:03.060
The true soldier who will
save the Earth!

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:04.100
That’s right!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.860
Why didn’t I notice?

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:10.690
So even Minto adores idols?

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.360
You’re wrong!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:14.580
Zakuro-oneesama is different!

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:20.260
It must be a coincidence
that God setup,

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.910
if someone that Minto-san adores is the fifth member.

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:25.970
Good timing. Everyone please go and confirm this.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:26.930
What?

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.620
Attend the audition.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.930
Audition?

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.150
HELP ME!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.570
NO!

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:11.500
So another one who interferes with us appeared?

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:13.500
Yes.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:16.350
Is she the last member?

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:17.930
Most likely.

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.980
However, they have not
made contact yet.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.440
We should deal with this quickly.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:26.650
I have already took
the proper measures.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:34.830
Japan and America’s Joint Musical

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:34.830
Starring Zakuro Fujiwara

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:39.670
Japan and America’s Joint Musical

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:39.670
Starring Zakuro Fujiwara

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:39.670
We’re going to attend the audition to see if Zakuro-san is a member.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.670
Shirogane-san sure thought of something wild.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.620
If I pass…

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:47.130
…I’m going to get the part of Zakuro’s little sister.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.210
I can’t believe it!!

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:53.100
I’m doing an audition… for a musical!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.800
Zakuro is here too, so I won’t allow you to screw up.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.020
But but but if I pass…

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.850
I’LL BE FAMOUS!

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:10.580
I’ll gather attention via a commercial, release a CD…

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.350
…and become a star in no time!

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>Autograph please, Ichigo-san!</i>

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.700
And, and…

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.360
<i>Ichigo, you’ve become a star.</i>

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:23.540
<i>Forget about me and fly freely.</i>

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.000
<i>Ma-Ma-Masaya you baka!</i>

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.080
<i>What?</i>

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.160
<i>Masaya…</i>

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:34.090
<i>Even if I become a celebrity,
my heart is yours!</i>

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:41.100
YEEAAAAHH!! Oh my!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.230
Please be serious!

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:47.150
<i>Participants of the audition!</i>

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:51.610
<i>The judges will now enter.</i>

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:02.110
That must be the director, Junyano Koshiba.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:07.160
Oh, the one who’s famous for being strict and making many new actresses cry?

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.130
Oh?

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:11.290
<i>And today’s special guest is,</i>

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.580
<i>the leading actress of this musical…</i>

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:15.100
<i>Fujiwara Zakuro!</i>

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.470
That’s Fujiwara Zakuro?

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:32.190
She’s the real one!.. Oh Zakuro…

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.280
We will now begin the audition.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:39.400
Number 15, Ms Aizawa Minto.

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.080
Yes!

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.410
Minto-san seems nervous.

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:49.750
That’s because she’s in front of her favorite Zakuro-san.

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:54.120
Emergency!

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.550
A small monkey who breathes fire is here!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.250
A small monkey who breathes fire?

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.980
Could it be a Chimera Anima?

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:10.480
How mean to leave me behind just because I’m an elementary student!

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:11.980
Bu-Ling!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.570
Bu-Ling wants to attend the audition, too!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:32.940
Hey Bu-Ling!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.660
Don’t breathe fire!

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:40.320
I can do a lot of acts!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.640
DON’T DO IT HERE!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.950
Then how about this?

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.870
I’ll hit this continuously!

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.920
Bu-Ling! CUT IT OUT!!

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.130
I want to get auditioned, too!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.090
That’s enough!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.260
<i>Cut it out!!</i>

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.120
What?

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.290
<i>Are you trying to make fun of me?</i>

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.600
Sorry, Mr. Koshiba.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:10.260
What are you girls doing?

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:12.540
You made Mr. Koshiba mad!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:15.050
Noooo… we’re sorry!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.010
The audition is cancelled!

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:20.930
Oh no…

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.750
I’m sorry!

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.950
But only her and I are the ones at fault.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.180
Me, too.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.700
We three will go home, so…

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:35.240
Please let Minto Aizawa here and the rest take the audition!

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.890
No No!

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.510
Everyone go home!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:40.970
May I?

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:50.800
<i>Oh please have a seat,</i>

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.470
<i>they’re not making fun of you.</i>

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.560
<i>This is just an accident.</i>

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:55.730
<i>Just an accident?</i>

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:59.400
<i>It seems to be that they’re
wasting my time.</i>

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:02.680
<i>Well, they’re trying to entertain you with their own show.</i>

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.700
Hey, that’s rude.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.530
Don’t worry. Leave it to me.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.080
<i>They’re taking this very seriously.</i>

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:15.230
<i>Nobody is trying to make a fool of you.</i>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.210
<i>To me, seems very ridiculous
in a strange…</i>

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.450
<i>I like to ask you to take
broadminded view…</i>

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:26.680
<i>I believe the things you considered strange and weird,</i>

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:30.460
<i>might bring you new ideas and…</i>

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.510
Wow.

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:30.460
She really does speak English so well!

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:34.190
<i>But I would like to see your dancing first.</i>

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.150
Mine?

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.650
Okay, I will.

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:45.440
Mr. Koshiba will resume the audition.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.820
Re-really!?

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:52.230
Yes. However, with the condition that I show an example.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.750
Isn’t that nice, Minto-san?

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.460
Yes. It’s just like… a dream come true.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.100
This is Zakuro-oneesama…

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.420
Wow, it’s so beautiful!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.390
Bravo! Bravo!!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:36.360
Zakuro… Zakuro-oneesama… The person that I admire!

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:37.980
Wait, Minto!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.030
Zakuro-oneesama!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.550
We came here to look
for our compatriot!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:50.220
Do you have some sort of
mark on your body?

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:54.250
That… that’s the symbol to prove you are a member!

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:58.600
What are you talking about?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:03.480
I just want to let work go smoothly… nothing else.

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:05.930
I didn’t intercede for you all.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.220
What?

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.870
Don’t get me wrong.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:24.190
So you all came home without taking the audition?

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:28.670
Yes, it seems Minto-san was shocked.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:33.470
Well, I guess the super popular Fujiwara Zakuro couldn’t have been it then.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.760
Hey, don’t say something like…

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.380
You’re the one who made us check!

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.900
Minto-oneechan!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:44.840
Bu-Ling is sorry for doing such a thing.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:48.340
It’s not your fault.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.860
I wonder if Zakuro-san
is really not a member?

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:55.270
If she’s not,
who is that in the picture?

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.510
Ichigo, wake up! Ichigo, wake up!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.530
What is it?

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:11.990
Order for everyone to rally. The fifth member is in danger, danger!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.870
What did you say?!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:17.850
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:49.470
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.930
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:02.150
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.900
This must be the place Shirogane told us to come to.

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:17.030
It’s a creepy place.

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:19.820
Is the fifth member in here?

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:21.560
Whatever the case, we have to go!

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:36.870
That’s…

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.480
Chimera Anima. Chimera Anima!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.540
What?!?

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:17.950
Oh? How did you all find out about this place?

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:19.660
Quiche!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.980
Oh well.

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:26.060
The dance party begins.
Dance as much as you want.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.400
With the crows!!

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:39.860
Ouch, that person…

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.680
Where did the fifth member go?

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.540
Can you not even take a step
because it’s so fun?

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:48.630
Quiche!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:57.030
Welcome everyone…
to the funeral of the fifth member!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:04.730
But to start the funeral,
I need her to die first.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:08.340
Why, what’s the matter?
You’re not moving.

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:11.000
You caused us a lot of trouble,

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.950
and now you can’t even speak once you fell into a trap?

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.360
KILL HER!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:32.360
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.860
So it IS Zakuro!

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:22.870
You returned all the Chimera Crows back to normal at once?

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:26.700
GO! Chimera Crow Great!

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:38.110
Her mobility is incredible!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:48.270
Reborn…

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.360
Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.320
Mew Pomegranate.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.060
Fujiwara Zakuro.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.700
Oneesama…

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.770
So you are a member!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.240
How stupid.

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:44.240
Sorry, but I have no intention to work with others.

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:49.330
I don’t need any friends.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:57.520
But… You’re the final member that we finally found!

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.690
Oneesama!

00:19:58.690 --> 00:19:59.340
Stop it!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.470
Girls like you are annoying!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:08.160
But…

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:29.040
Emergency! Minto is dozing off
and acting weird!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.560
She must be shocked since her favorite Zakuro-san gave her harsh words.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:38.590
Zakuro is a bad sister for picking on Minto! I’ll defeat her!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:39.340
PuddingRings…

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.070
Don’t!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.570
If we believe, she will open up her heart.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:46.620
Because, Zakuro-san is our friend!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:50.450
Next time: The Heart to Believe,
All Five Makes Tokyo Mew Mew!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:53.380
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
